   Role: SLURM submission and job monitoring
     • check_job_status(job_id, remote_host, remote_user, ssh_key_path): Check status of submitted SLURM job.
     • copy_simulation_files(source_dir, dest_dir, file_patterns, create_dest): Copy simulation files from setup directory to HPC working directory.
     • create_gromacs_continuation_script(manifest_path, job_name, partition, nodes, ntasks, cpus_per_task, memory, time_limit, gpu_count, gromacs_module, email, output_script): Generate a continuation-only SLURM script from a prepared manifest.
