     • download_results(remote_dir, local_dir, file_patterns, remote_host, remote_user, ssh_key_path): Download simulation results from HPC system.
     • estimate_simulation_time(production_ns, system_size, timestep_ps): Estimate simulation walltime based on system size and simulation length.
     • inspect_gromacs_continuation(simulation_dir, deffnm): Inspect whether an existing GROMACS run can be extended from checkpoint.
