         working_dir (required): Combined analysis directory.
         definition_json (optional): Pocket definition JSON from ``define_reference_consensus_pocket``.
         labels (optional): Optional subset of labels to export.
         min_coverage (optional): Minimum mapped-position fraction to mark a label usable.
