         trajectory_file (required): Trajectory file (.xtc, .trr)
         query_selection (required): Reference group (e.g. "chainID B and resid 1:34")
         neighbor_selection (required): Group to search (e.g. "chainID A")
         cutoff (optional): Distance cutoff in Ångström (default 15.0)
         frame (optional): Trajectory frame used to define neighbors (default 0)
